  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby\r\ncertify that on 06/02/2025, the existing use of 50 Queens Road, TW13 5AR as\r\na small house in multiple occupation with no more than 6 occupants (Use\r\nClass C4) as shown on drawings submitted on 06/02/2025 and numbered\r\nA2024297.PA101, A2024297.PA102, A2024297.PA103, A2024297.PA109,\r\nsupporting statement is lawful within the meaning of Section 191 of the Town\r\nand Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reason:\r\nThe existing use complies with the requirements of Schedule 2, Part 3, Class\r\nL of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development)\r\n(England) Order 2015 (as amended) and it has been demonstrated, on a\r\nbalance of probability, that this use commenced prior to the Council's\r\nborough-wide small HMOs Article 4 Direction coming into effect."
  ],
